Package: arfix
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: xenoZ0x <noreply@example.com>
Description: Fix Arabic text rendering (reshaping + BiDi) in terminals - Termux build
 Reshapes Arabic text (connects letters) and applies correct RTL
 ordering so it displays correctly in terminals that don't support
 Arabic shaping/BiDi natively (e.g. Termux). Provides two commands:
 arfix (fix text directly) and smartcat (wrap any command's output).
